### Exclusions

Of the sixteen participants of the Full
sample, six failed the learning check in at least
one stage and were thus excluded
(see the top table below for stage-by-stage counts). Stage 3, the stage with the
fewest trials and the last one before the test, was failed by
all
six of them.


::: {#tbl-feasibility-stage-tests .cell tbl-cap='Number of participants of the Full sample whose accuracy was significantly above chance, per learning stage.'}

